<?php
return ['name' => 'attuned_bing_fire_the_spark', 'displayTitle' => ['en' => 'Attuned Bing Fire – The Spark', 'zh' => '身弱丙火'], 'locales' => ['en' => ['sections' => ['overview' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<p>Bing Fire is the sun; Attuned Bing Fire is like a sunbeam or spark – still bright and warm, but with limited heat and reach unless aided by outside fuel. Attuned Bing Fire\'s light isn\'t about burning at high noon, but rather about releasing a unique flash of brilliance at critical moments to illuminate the darkness. As an Attuned Bing Fire, it is small but mighty: like a spark that can ignite hope and motivation. With precise timing and support, its seemingly modest flame plays an irreplaceable role.</p><p>Sensitive inside: Outwardly you\'re cheerful and straightforward, but inside you tend to worry and overthink. When setbacks hit, you might be quick to self-doubt despite your upbeat and outgoing appearance.<br/>Open-minded: You instinctively look at challenges from multiple angles, with a perspective that\'s broad and versatile. You excel at grasping the big picture and envisioning possibilities that others might overlook.</p>'], 'love' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<p>Wood and Fire. A small flame grows brighter when it\'s given wood for fuel and fire for warmth. With the steady support of Wood energy (structure and grounding) and the encouragement of Fire energy (passion and enthusiasm), your inner spark is nourished into a steady glow. These elements make sure your light doesn\'t flicker out, but instead burns brighter and stronger, revealing your true strengths.</p>'], 'career' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<h4>Wealth</h4><p>For you, learning to save money is more important than making money. Early on, money may slip through your fingers easily – income comes in but goes out just as fast. The key is to cultivate the habit of holding on to wealth. Once you master the art of saving and managing finances, your resources will gradually stabilize and grow. Avoid trying to do everything alone financially; building wealth through partnerships or established platforms can be much more effective. If investing, favor long-term cultural or tech projects that align with your interests, and avoid short-term speculation entirely.</p><h4>Health</h4><p>Pay attention to your cardiovascular health – maintain regular sleep patterns and exercise moderately. Protect your eyesight by reducing screen time and eye strain. Prevent chronic inflammation by avoiding overly spicy or stimulating foods. Essentially, routine and balanced self-care (enough movement, rest, and a soothing diet) will keep you feeling well.</p><h4>Emotional Wellbeing</h4><p>Your mind can spiral into over-analysis and anxiety if you don\'t find outlets. It\'s beneficial for you to \'stay out of your head\' by moving your body. Exercise to release anxious energy and break the cycle of overthinking. Also, remember the mantra \'done is better than perfect.\' Embrace the notion that completing tasks, even imperfectly, is more valuable than endless worrying. This mindset shift will free you from a lot of unnecessary stress.</p><h4>Career Pathways</h4><p>Where You Flourish: Culture & Education: Teacher, trainer, writer, publisher, academic researcher, study-abroad consultant – areas where you share knowledge and guide others in a structured way. Consulting & Coaching: Psychologist, career planner, brand strategist, marketing advisor – one-on-one or small team consulting suits your thoughtful and broad-minded approach. Creative Media: Designer (graphic/UI/UX), content creator, screenwriter, advertising planner, new media operations – you can express your ideas creatively and flexibly here. Health & Wellness: Traditional Chinese medicine doctor, physical therapist, nutritionist, yoga/Pilates instructor, wellness coach – roles where you help others heal and maintain health, which aligns with your gentle motivation style. Green Energy & Tech Support: Renewable energy industry roles, user experience or tech support – blending innovation with service, often within forward-looking fields. Culinary & Leisure: Chef, baker, tea artist, floral arranger – creative yet calming professions where you craft enjoyable experiences for others. Social Services & Philosophy: Social worker, nonprofit staff, clergy, philosopher – arenas where big-picture thinking and compassion are valued over cut-throat competition. Where Energy Feels Drained: Finance & Law: Banking, stock trading, high-risk investing, trial lawyer, auditing – these demanding, high-stakes jobs might overstress you. Shipping & Maritime: Seafaring, port management, commercial fishing, international trading on the docks – too rough-and-tumble and far from your interests. Heavy Industry: Geology fieldwork, mining extraction, metallurgy, mechanical manufacturing – physically and mentally grueling, with little room for your creative touch. Military/Police/Judiciary: Strict disciplines like being a soldier, judge, or prison warden demand toughness and confrontation that could overwhelm your sensitive nature. Water Engineering: Civil engineering for waterworks, sewage treatment, cold-chain logistics – these technical heavy fields might not engage your heart and could feel monotonous.</p>'], 'relationship_friends' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Jia Wood: A steadfast friend who lends you resilience and direction.</li><li>Wu Earth: A solid, dependable friend who provides a shoulder to lean on.</li></ul>'], 'relationship_couple' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Jia Wood: A partner with strong shoulders who takes responsibility and faces life\'s challenges with you.</li><li>Ji Earth: A partner who grounds your restlessness and provides deep emotional security.</li></ul>'], 'celebrities_international' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Nelson Mandela: South Africa\'s first black president, who fought apartheid with steadfast, non-violent resolve (compassionate and broad-minded, like a spark that lit change)</li><li>Leonardo DiCaprio: Oscar-winning actor and environmental activist (a passionate advocate using his influence for climate causes – turning a spark of concern into global action)</li><li>Serena Williams: Tennis legend who has championed maternal health and education in Africa and the Americas while dominating her sport</li><li>Albert Einstein: Theoretical physicist known for creativity and pacifism, who opposed nuclear weapons proliferation</li><li>Immanuel Kant: Enlightenment philosopher who proposed the \'categorical imperative\' and perpetual peace theory, reshaping ethics (a deep thinker staying true to principles)</li></ul>'], 'celebrities_domestic' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Yu Minhong (Michael Yu): Founder of New Oriental Education, an entrepreneur and teacher who steadily built one of China\'s largest education companies (his calm, methodical approach mirrors yours)</li></ul>'], 'luckSuggestion_dailyTips' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Get sunshine in the morning – literally go out and soak in sunlight to recharge your yang energy for the day</li><li>Keep a small potted plant on your desk – nurturing a bit of greenery at work brings you peace and a subtle energy boost</li></ul>'], 'luckSuggestion_color' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Red & Gold (Fire): A combination of red and golden hues provides focus and courage. Red infuses you with passion; gold adds concentration and decisiveness. Using red-gold accents (say, a phone case or keychain) can effectively \'push\' you to carry plans through, giving your spark more power.</li><li>Green (Wood): Green symbolizes growth and circulation. It clarifies your thoughts and also attracts helpful mentors (\'nobleman luck\'). Incorporating green (perhaps a plant, or wearing green) is like inviting wisdom and support into your life, helping your actions flow more smoothly.</li></ul>'], 'luckSuggestion_location' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>South (Fire): Facing south enhances your presence and influence, making you more noticeable and impactful in work and social settings. In daily life, try to face south during important meetings or arrange beloved objects to the south – it\'s like lighting a warm spotlight on you, increasing your visibility and charisma.</li><li>East (Wood): Eastern energy fosters growth and creativity. Spend time facing east or situate your creative thinking space toward the east – it helps ideas sprout and brings order to your plans, so you can act with better organization.</li></ul>']]], 'zh' => ['sections' => ['overview' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<p>丙火为太阳之火，光芒炽烈，然而身弱则光热不足，力量有限，常需借助外力才能被引燃。它的价值不在于如日中天的炽烈，而在于在关键时刻释放出独一无二的光热，点亮环境。</p><p>内心敏感：表面热情爽朗，内心敏感多虑，遇挫折时容易自我否定。<br/>思维开阔：看问题角度多元，善于多角度思考事物。</p>'], 'love' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<p>身弱丙火，喜用神是木、火。丙火身弱时容易热情不足或力量分散。若能借助木火之力，就能稳步提升能量。</p>'], 'career' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<h4>财富运势</h4><p>学会存钱比会赚钱更重要。前期易财来财去，学会守财后可逐步稳固。需规避单打独斗，通过合作或平台资源积累财富。</p><h4>健康隐患</h4><p>关注心血管健康，作息规律、多运动；注意视力保养，减少用眼疲劳；预防慢性炎症，少吃刺激性食物。</p><h4>情绪管理</h4><p>通过运动释放焦虑，避免过度思辨，培养\'完成比完美重要\'的心态。</p><h4>职业管理</h4><p>推荐行业：教育培训：学校、培训机构、在线教育、职业培训。文化传播：出版社、杂志社、电视台、电台、公关公司。生态保护：环保组织、动物保护、公益事业、慈善机构。能源：电力、石油、燃气、新能源、太阳能。设计师：室内设计、设计师、建筑师、品牌策划。新媒体：新媒体运营、内容创作、社交媒体管理。宠物行业：宠物店、宠物医院、宠物用品、宠物培训。社区服务：社区管理、社工、社区发展、养老服务。慎重行业：水产养殖：渔场、水产养殖基地、海鲜批发。游泳培训：游泳教练、水上运动、潜水、水上游乐。水利工程系统：水利局、水厂、河道管理、灌溉系统。船员：轮船、货船、游艇、海上作业。会计：会计师、财务管理、税务、审计。</p>'], 'relationship_friends' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>甲木：甲木的坚韧与目标感可以帮助你聚焦方向和能量。</li><li>戊土：戊土是可靠踏实的朋友，在相处过程中可以帮助你疏解压力。</li></ul>'], 'relationship_couple' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>甲木：甲木是具有担当的伴侣，与你共同面对生活的困境，增强你的耐力。</li><li>己土：己土可以收敛你浮躁，为情绪敏感的你提供更多安全感。</li></ul>'], 'celebrities_international' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Nelson Mandela：南非首任黑人总统，反种族隔离，坚持非暴力抗争</li><li>Leonardo DiCaprio：奥斯卡影帝</li><li>Serena Williams：网球传奇，倡导孕产妇健康权益，资助非洲与美洲贫困地区教育</li><li>Albert Einstein：相对论提出者，倡导和平主义，反对核武器扩散</li><li>Immanuel Kant：启蒙思想家，提出\'道德律令\'与永久和平理论，重塑现代伦理学框架</li></ul>'], 'celebrities_domestic' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>俞敏洪：新东方创始人</li><li>张怡宁：乒乓球大满贯得主</li></ul>'], 'luckSuggestion_dailyTips' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>早晨起来多晒太阳，吸收阳光能量</li><li>办公桌面可以摆放绿植</li></ul>'], 'luckSuggestion_color' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>红色（火）：金色带来聚焦与果断，让身弱丙火在关键时刻更有力量。</li><li>绿色（木）：绿色象征生长与流通，能提升思维清晰度，同时带来贵人运。</li></ul>'], 'luckSuggestion_location' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>南方（火）：南方的能量能增强气场，让丙火的存在感和影响力更明显。</li><li>东方（木）：东方的能量象征生长与创造力。在这个方位更容易激发灵感与创意。</li></ul>']]]], 'version' => 1];
